1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,290
Your dog tilts its head, and it's not just to look cute.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:11,410
In one study, dogs that knew the names of lots of toys tilted their heads almost half the time when their owner said a toy's name.

3
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:14,130
Ordinary dogs barely did it at all.

4
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,270
So the tilt may be your dog matching the word to the toy in its memory.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,920
Another idea: a long snout blocks part of your face,

6
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,810
and tilting helps them see you.

7
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:26,580
And in that study, each dog had a favorite side,

8
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,260
like being left- or right-handed.

9
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:31,540
So watch which way yours goes when you ask,

10
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:32,500
who wants a walk?
